- Y-You're wrong!

00:06:21.250 --> 00:06:23.350
Popu, don't be rude to the guest.

00:06:23.410 --> 00:06:24.820
Huh?

00:06:29.010 --> 00:06:31.520
- On your way home from work?
- Y-Yes.

00:06:31.590 --> 00:06:33.270
Or from a murder?

00:06:34.040 --> 00:06:36.830
Hey, don't interfere
with my investigation!

00:06:37.050 --> 00:06:38.700
