00:06:38.780 --> 00:06:40.230
Or murder?

00:06:40.310 --> 00:06:42.340
You idiots!

00:06:44.320 --> 00:06:47.800
Inn Madam

00:06:47.820 --> 00:06:51.290
Okay, forensics... Did you find anything?

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:54.010
