- Wow, you're amazing.

00:06:54.070 --> 00:06:56.430
- I didn't know.
- Probably a blunt weapon.

00:06:56.500 --> 00:06:58.170
It took one blow.

00:06:58.510 --> 00:07:02.320
Get these two... outta here!

00:07:04.670 --> 00:07:07.730
I guess that's as far as
we amateurs will get.

00:07:08.090 --> 00:07:09.930
I'll keep you company.

00:07:10.570 --> 00:07:14.780
After all, you're Ginza's top busybody.

00:07:18.030 --> 00:07:20.660
I sure am. Thank you, Popu.

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:24.210
Well then, let's get to work ourselves.

00:07:24.300 --> 00:07:25.210
Yes!

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:29.990
The killer is still in this inn.
We need to gather evidence.

00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:33.370
The basic rule of detective work...
is thorough data gathering!

00:07:33.430 --> 00:07:38.700
I recall that my late husband...
got up so many times...

00:07:38.760 --> 00:07:41.360
to go to take a pee.

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:47.010
