00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:30.780
You're the murderer, right?

00:09:31.240 --> 00:09:32.690
I couldn't forgive him!

00:09:32.760 --> 00:09:36.350
Fifteen years ago, because of that man,
my father...

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:40.390
I'm going to join Father now...

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:44.190
Ginza is a mirror
that reflects the human soul.

00:09:45.590 --> 00:09:48.540
Your death won't appease any soul.

00:09:48.630 --> 00:09:52.700
But... I'm a terrible woman!
I deserve to die!

00:09:52.770 --> 00:09:53.550
Fool!

00:09:53.990 --> 00:09:57.800
In Ginza, we call women like you,
a damn fool!

00:09:57.920 --> 00:09:58.890
I'm sorry...

00:09:59.690 --> 00:10:00.760
I'm so sorry!

00:10:01.670 --> 00:10:04.930
When you've served your time,
come to my place for a drink.

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:08.840
It'll be on the house.

00:10:09.030 --> 00:10:12.510
We'll always be waiting for you in Ginza.

