00:19:45.720 --> 00:19:47.510
Hey, you look like Det. Kogoro.

00:19:49.960 --> 00:19:51.710
Okay, Mama, everyone's here.

00:19:52.130 --> 00:19:54.220
Thank you, Popu.

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:56.920
Um... Why did you call us?

00:19:57.120 --> 00:19:59.980
Don't tell me...
You know who the killer is?!

00:20:00.150 --> 00:20:02.320
I-I didn't do it!

00:20:02.510 --> 00:20:06.680
Now, now... Quiet down, everyone.

00:20:09.990 --> 00:20:15.760
I started working in Ginza
when this nation still had life.

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:20.790
Everything back then was
fresh and dazzling.

00:20:21.490 --> 00:20:23.420
I accepted Ginza...

00:20:23.660 --> 00:20:27.370
And Ginza accepted me in return.

00:20:27.720 --> 00:20:33.000
Club Pipimi

00:20:27.880 --> 00:20:29.170
Ready...

00:20:29.520 --> 00:20:32.890
Congratulations on your 25th anniversary,
Mama Pipimi!

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:39.510
25th Anniversary

00:20:33.090 --> 00:20:34.840
- This is for you.
- Oh my...

00:20:34.890 --> 00:20:36.850
It's our gift from all of us.

00:20:36.930 --> 00:20:39.470
Mama, go and relax for a change.

00:20:39.550 --> 00:20:42.370
Everyone... Thank you!

00:20:42.570 --> 00:20:45.530
Mama, we're sending Popuko
to accompany you.

00:20:45.590 --> 00:20:46.980
Huh? Me?

00:20:47.040 --> 00:20:51.410
You deserve it for topping sales
last month as a newbie.

00:20:51.530 --> 00:20:53.100
Have fun!

00:21:00.130 --> 00:21:03.650
This trip was a present of love
from all the girls...

00:21:03.740 --> 00:21:06.170
And it's been spoiled by the killer!

00:21:06.290 --> 00:21:09.430
What? Are you saying
it's all my fault?!

00:21:10.800 --> 00:21:12.020
Th-That's...

00:21:12.600 --> 00:21:15.360
How was I to know...

00:21:15.610 --> 00:21:18.100
that we had such an important guest?!

00:21:19.200 --> 00:21:21.070
You're the murderer, right?

00:21:21.320 --> 00:21:22.800
I couldn't forgive him!

00:21:22.870 --> 00:21:26.470
Fifteen years ago, because of that man,
my father...

00:21:27.440 --> 00:21:30.450
I'm going to join Father now...

00:21:30.900 --> 00:21:34.030
Ginza is a mirror
of the human soul.

00:21:35.650 --> 00:21:38.350
Your death won't appease any soul.

00:21:38.690 --> 00:21:42.630
But... I'm a terrible woman!
I deserve to die!

00:21:42.630 --> 00:21:43.530
Fool!

00:21:44.030 --> 00:21:47.440
In Ginza, we call women like you,
a damn fool!

00:21:47.980 --> 00:21:48.960
I'm sorry...

00:21:49.760 --> 00:21:50.720
I'm so sorry!

00:21:51.730 --> 00:21:55.240
When you've served your time,
come to my place for a drink.

00:21:56.900 --> 00:21:59.060
There's probably only one truth.

00:21:59.120 --> 00:22:02.480
You'll always find us in Kinshicho,
waiting for you.

00:22:04.760 --> 00:22:08.480
Kinshichou Station...
The doors are closing.

00:22:08.560 --> 00:22:09.670
Damn it, I overslept!

00:22:09.840 --> 00:22:11.930
Too bad, that was the last train.

00:23:18.250 --> 00:23:22.920
This is a work of fiction.
 Characters, organizations,
and incidents are purely fictitious.

00:23:22.920 --> 00:23:39.920
Preview

00:23:23.120 --> 00:23:24.680
I'm Sosogu Hoshifuri.

00:23:24.770 --> 00:23:27.730
Oh no! Daiichi wants to
discover his real self,

00:23:27.790 --> 00:23:29.980
and plans to study abroad!

00:23:30.050 --> 00:23:32.200
We're going to be separated!

00:23:31.530 --> 00:23:39.920
Hoshiiro Girldrop - Episode 11
"The Sudden Break-up"

00:23:32.280 --> 00:23:35.710
Hoshiiro Girldrop - Episode 11
"The Sudden Break-up"

00:23:35.840 --> 00:23:38.680
Fall in love again next week!
